---
to: "releases/earned/{{ slug }}.md"
for_each: rows
sparql:
  rows: |
    PREFIX frf: <https://ggen.io/ontology/frontier-release-factory#>
    SELECT ?release ?slug ?release_title ?verified_claim ?subject_identity
           ?verifier_identity ?evidence_ref ?replay_ref ?standing
           ?benchmark_id ?acceptance_predicate ?falsifier ?publisher ?source_url
    WHERE {
      ?release a frf:EarnedRelease ;
               frf:slug ?slug ;
               frf:observedClaim ?claim ;
               frf:forOpportunity ?opportunity .
      ?receipt a frf:EvidenceReceipt ;
               frf:supportsClaim ?claim ;
               frf:subjectIdentity ?subject_identity ;
               frf:verifierIdentity ?verifier_identity ;
               frf:evidenceRef ?evidence_ref ;
               frf:replayRef ?replay_ref ;
               frf:standing ?standing .
      ?opportunity frf:benchmark ?benchmark .
      ?benchmark frf:benchmarkId ?benchmark_id ;
                 frf:acceptancePredicate ?acceptance_predicate ;
                 frf:falsifier ?falsifier .
      OPTIONAL { ?release frf:releaseTitle ?release_title . }
      OPTIONAL { ?release frf:verifiedClaim ?verified_claim . }
      OPTIONAL {
        ?source frf:derivedOpportunity ?opportunity ;
                frf:publisher ?publisher ;
                frf:sourceUrl ?source_url .
      }
    }
    ORDER BY ?slug
---
# {{ release_title | default(value=slug) }}

_Status: EARNED RELEASE — render only from verified evidence-bearing claims._

## What shipped

{{ verified_claim | default(value="") }}

## External context

This work was triggered by {{ publisher | default(value="(none admitted)") }}'s announcement at {{ source_url | default(value="(none admitted)") }}. The external announcement is provenance and comparison context; it is not evidence for this release's standing.

## Executed evidence

- Exact subject: `{{ subject_identity }}`
- Verifier: `{{ verifier_identity }}`
- Execution receipt: `{{ evidence_ref }}`
- Replay: `{{ replay_ref }}`
- Standing: `{{ standing }}`

## Benchmark

- Benchmark: `{{ benchmark_id }}`
- Acceptance: {{ acceptance_predicate }}
- Falsifier: {{ falsifier }}

## Claim fence

No claim in this release is admitted solely from a working-backwards draft, source article, generated artifact, model output, workflow configuration, or unexecuted plan.
